{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/cce633f910b3f586cb9352029dbae61c.poster.avif?t=1759002432\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/cce633f910b3f586cb9352029dbae61c.webm?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/cce633f910b3f586cb9352029dbae61c.mp4?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of every planet lies a primordial being whose latent energy sparked life to grow upon them. After a sudden exile, the heroes are stranded.\u00a0Each hero must prove themselves to Kravok to earn their freedom, but can the fallen God be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primarch is a roguelike auto-battler where you refine the skills and strategy of a single unit, instead of a party.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the perfect weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/3911ea1301389e6b200300e47609fc0f.poster.avif?t=1759002432\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/3911ea1301389e6b200300e47609fc0f.webm?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/3911ea1301389e6b200300e47609fc0f.mp4?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb, fuse, and mutate the skills of your foes to create new effects, then further augment your strength with the passive benefits of trinkets and talents. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death is only the beginning</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon falling in battle, a hero will enter \u2018Primal Mode\u2019, where a limited resource called \u2018Primal\u2019 will be used instead of hit points. A hero\u2019s hit points are restored after each combat, but run out of Primal, and it\u2019s all over. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhabitants of planet Kravok are split into 8 tribes, each mastering a different set of elements. You gain a bonus effect when equipping multiple skills from the same tribe, and when dealing damage with the same element. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge your path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/94bc22d3e0fa1d7776c5688dff4cf43d.poster.avif?t=1759002432\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/94bc22d3e0fa1d7776c5688dff4cf43d.webm?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/94bc22d3e0fa1d7776c5688dff4cf43d.mp4?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the world as you desire, with the ability to hunt down specific tribes and event locations. Ferocious tribes, doom spires, glowing craters, breathing rifts, and so much more stand in your way - do you have what it takes to earn your freedom?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1668970?t=1759002432","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759002432","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/77f87dfb32254ff43413b686c201aedfa35434d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759002432","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/77f87dfb32254ff43413b686c201aedfa35434d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759002432","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/cce633f910b3f586cb9352029dbae61c.poster.avif?t=1759002432\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/cce633f910b3f586cb9352029dbae61c.webm?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1668970/extras/cce633f910b3f586cb9352029dbae61c.mp4?t=1759002432\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of every planet lies a primordial being whose latent energy sparked life to grow upon them. After a sudden exile, the heroes are stranded.\u00a0Each hero must prove themselves to Kravok to earn their freedom, but can the fallen God be trusted?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primarch is a roguelike auto-battler where you refine the skills and strategy of a single unit, instead of a party.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the perfect weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=